# cc-switch reference checkout (used by the import_cc_switch tool).
# Path is user-specific; conventional locations on this machine:
#   macOS / Linux: ~/Documents/Codex/2026-07-05/ben/work/cc-switch-src/
#   Windows:       C:\Users\<you>\Documents\Codex\2026-07-05\ben\work\cc-switch-src\
#   anywhere:      <repo>/cc-switch-src/  (symlink-friendly)
# We don't pin the path here (it's user-specific and would break for
# others). If you copy a fresh checkout into the repo root, prefer
# `/cc-switch-src/` as the ignored name.
/cc-switch-src/

